TYPES.md §15, §12.1 (E3015): a parameter default that reads a let is reported by the checker
only; the folder never forces the let.
-- pipeline/potion.canon --
/// Potions.
package pipeline

/// The heal of a potion, capped.
fn heal(cap: Int = zzLimit) -> Int {
  return cap
}

local let zzLimit: Int = 3

/// The heal.
let healed: Int = heal()
